---
code: field.name.camel-case
description: Normalize field names to lower camelCase (user_name -> userName, displayName -> displayName)
default-enabled: false
---

# Mainstream lowerCamelCase: separators, camel humps and acronym boundaries are
# word boundaries (user_name -> userName, URLValue -> urlValue).
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.toCamelCase(it.fieldName())
```
